; downstream load/store optimizer can form LDP/STP.
;
; The cases below use NEGATIVE far offsets, which (unlike positive far offsets)
; cannot be expressed as a single unsigned scaled immediate and therefore
; require base-address CSE to pair.  With the pass disabled (-aarch64-base-address-cse=0,
; NOBASECSE) the two accesses stay as separate sub+ldr/str with no LDP/STP.

